{"unit_id":"QuanhuZeYu__dsh-session-header#card-zh","repo":"QuanhuZeYu/dsh-session-header","commit":"407ad712c8b11df0d004015bf033bf392d6cc3a0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 是一个适用于 DSH 各客户端的插件：它监听全局 llm/stream 调用，并包装 globalThis.fetch，将当前会话 ID 写入模型请求头。它能为主会话和辅助调用分别传递稳定的会话标识，在异步作用域缺失时从符合模型请求特征的请求体读取 prompt_cache_key，也可将同一值写入多个自定义头并按配置决定是否覆盖现有值。适合需要让自建网关按会话识别或转发请求的 DSH 用户。默认头名为 x-session-id；目标网关需要配置相应的头转发规则。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:87-98","src/index.ts:111-143","src/inject.ts:185-202","src/inject.ts:306-356"]}
{"unit_id":"QuanhuZeYu__dsh-session-header#card-en","repo":"QuanhuZeYu/dsh-session-header","commit":"407ad712c8b11df0d004015bf033bf392d6cc3a0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-header adds a session ID to DSH model request headers by tracing llm/stream calls and wrapping fetch. It preserves IDs across asynchronous calls and can fall back to prompt_cache_key in matching model request bodies. Configure the header and overwrite behavior; gateways must forward it.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:87-98","src/index.ts:111-143","src/inject.ts:185-202","src/inject.ts:306-356"]}
{"unit_id":"QuanhuZeYu__dsh-session-header#intent-1","repo":"QuanhuZeYu/dsh-session-header","commit":"407ad712c8b11df0d004015bf033bf392d6cc3a0","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"想让自建网关收到每个 DSH 模型请求对应的会话 ID。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:87-98","src/inject.ts:332-356"]}
{"unit_id":"QuanhuZeYu__dsh-session-header#intent-2","repo":"QuanhuZeYu/dsh-session-header","commit":"407ad712c8b11df0d004015bf033bf392d6cc3a0","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"能不能把当前对话的标识放进发给模型的 HTTP 头里？","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:87-98","src/inject.ts:332-356"]}
{"unit_id":"QuanhuZeYu__dsh-session-header#intent-3","repo":"QuanhuZeYu/dsh-session-header","commit":"407ad712c8b11df0d004015bf033bf392d6cc3a0","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"让并行的子 agent 请求各自带上所属会话的 ID。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/inject.ts:261-280","src/index.ts:87-98"]}
{"unit_id":"QuanhuZeYu__dsh-session-header#intent-4","repo":"QuanhuZeYu/dsh-session-header","commit":"407ad712c8b11df0d004015bf033bf392d6cc3a0","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"会话信息在异步调用里丢了时，希望还能从模型请求体里补出标识。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/inject.ts:185-202","src/inject.ts:319-329"]}
{"unit_id":"QuanhuZeYu__dsh-session-header#intent-5","repo":"QuanhuZeYu/dsh-session-header","commit":"407ad712c8b11df0d004015bf033bf392d6cc3a0","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Add a session identifier header to each model request sent through my gateway.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:111-128","src/inject.ts:332-356"]}
{"unit_id":"QuanhuZeYu__dsh-session-header#intent-6","repo":"QuanhuZeYu/dsh-session-header","commit":"407ad712c8b11df0d004015bf033bf392d6cc3a0","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Keep parallel agent requests associated with their own conversation IDs.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/inject.ts:261-280","src/index.ts:87-98"]}
{"unit_id":"QuanhuZeYu__dsh-session-header#feature-1","repo":"QuanhuZeYu/dsh-session-header","commit":"407ad712c8b11df0d004015bf033bf392d6cc3a0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 的功能「按会话注入请求头」：为 llm/stream 调用建立会话作用域，并在模型请求通过 fetch 发出时添加会话 ID。作用域随异步流传递，主会话和辅助调用可分别携带自己的标识。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:87-98","src/inject.ts:261-280","src/inject.ts:332-356"]}
{"unit_id":"QuanhuZeYu__dsh-session-header#feature-2","repo":"QuanhuZeYu/dsh-session-header","commit":"407ad712c8b11df0d004015bf033bf392d6cc3a0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 的功能「请求体会话标识兜底」：作用域没有会话值时，可从符合模型调用特征的请求体读取 prompt_cache_key，并将它用作请求头中的会话 ID。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/inject.ts:185-202","src/inject.ts:306-329"]}
{"unit_id":"QuanhuZeYu__dsh-session-header#feature-3","repo":"QuanhuZeYu/dsh-session-header","commit":"407ad712c8b11df0d004015bf033bf392d6cc3a0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 的功能「自定义会话头」：可配置主头名称和额外头名称，并选择是否覆盖请求中已有的同名头。每次命中时把同一个会话 ID 写入指定头。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/inject.ts:34-47","src/inject.ts:138-173","src/inject.ts:332-356"]}
{"unit_id":"QuanhuZeYu__dsh-session-header#feature-4","repo":"QuanhuZeYu/dsh-session-header","commit":"407ad712c8b11df0d004015bf033bf392d6cc3a0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-header 的功能「插件启停和卸载恢复」：enabled 关闭时不注册监听器或包装 fetch；启用后若插件卸载且 fetch 仍由本插件占据最外层，则恢复原始 fetch 函数。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:80-86","src/index.ts:128-143"]}
